    rdf:value """Sunday, August 13,1916, Villa Bice
Iris 14° birthday. Miss Trelauney and Nesta de Roebeck came over, and we had a picnic tea in the wood and played games. I feel very low. Can’t shake off this cold."""^^xsd:string ;
